; The test lanes' unit (C5, D1): lanes_gen.ml is GENERATED by `make gen-lcnf` with the api
; artifact (ocaml/gen/roots.json), whose consumers are the to-do, constructor, Modeled and Rocq
; lanes. One walk of the artifact's roots and then every consumer's roots makes one closure:
; every node the api roots reach is compiled once, in ../../../gen/closure_gen.ml (the
; package-private library effect4_closure), and this unit compiles the nodes only the lanes'
; roots reach. It includes the closure, so the lanes share each node with Api_gen and with each
; other. Each lane reads it through its own facade (../todo/todo_gen.ml, ../ctors/ctors_gen.ml,
; ../modeled/modeled_gen.ml, ../rocq/rocq_gen.ml, GENERATED with it), whose interface keeps that
; lane's roots and the types they name. A test library: nothing installs it, so an outside client
; names none of its roots. Its join points are `let[@local always]`, so warning 55 is an error,
; as in ../../../gen/dune.

(library
 (name effect4_lanes)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules lanes_gen)
 (flags
  (:standard -w @55))
 (no_dynlink)
 (libraries effect4_closure effect4_eff zarith effect4_lcnf))
